<title>USA: Suffolk Cty, N.Y., notes won by Fleet, Oppenheimer.</title>
<headline>Suffolk Cty, N.Y., notes won by Fleet, Oppenheimer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc won $85 million of Suffolk County, N.Y.'s tax anticipation note deal, and Oppenheimer &amp; Co won the remaining $10 million, market sources said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Fleet's net interest cost was a 3.9905 percent and Oppenheimer's was a 3.9868 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
